From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: My Workspace patches <claude@local>
Date: Sat, 31 Oct 2026 20:39:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 2/3] rpc/msg: check the caller on read and read-marking RPCs

PullMessageBySeqs, GetSeqMessage, GetLastMessage,
GetConversationsHasReadAndMaxSeq, SetConversationHasReadSeq,
MarkMsgsAsRead and MarkConversationAsRead now require the caller to be
the user in the request (or an app manager). SearchMessage is app
manager only. These RPCs are only called by the API, the message
gateway and the JS SDK API, which act as the caller.
---
 internal/rpc/msg/as_read.go  | 13 +++++++++++++
 internal/rpc/msg/sync_msg.go | 12 ++++++++++++
 2 files changed, 25 insertions(+)

diff --git a/internal/rpc/msg/as_read.go b/internal/rpc/msg/as_read.go
